0..70 Comment "//! A model and a fold that do not prove the symmetry of a commutative"
71..85 Comment "//! operation."
86..89 Comment "//!"
90..165 Comment "//! The rule `meet x y <=> meet y x` joins two terms of the theory. A model"
166..243 Comment "//! that gives the meet a meaning must give those two terms one value. A fold"
244..320 Comment "//! over the terms must give them one result. Without a proof, a program can"
321..351 Comment "//! tell the two orders apart."
352..355 Comment "//!"
356..432 Comment "//! The checker reads the symmetry as it reads each rule. A model that omits"
433..510 Comment "//! the law is refused where its two sides do not convert. A fold that states"
511..560 Comment "//! no respect of the law is refused at its case."
561..564 Comment "//!"
565..581 Comment "//! - see: #8291"
